message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Verified non-recursive calculation of Beneš networks applied to Classic McEliece"
abstract: >-
  Artifacts accompanying the paper "Verified non-recursive calculation of Beneš
  networks applied to Classic McEliece": reference Python specifications, a
  Mathlib-dependent Lean formalisation and verified proofs of the control-bit
  formulae, and portable and vectorised C implementations.
type: software
